WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.915
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:08.185 --> 00:09.025
SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

3
01:44.145 --> 01:46.425
I've finished the revisions. I'll email it to you in a bit.

4
01:47.145 --> 01:48.065
Bye.

5
01:51.345 --> 01:52.745
Sir, your package.

6
01:52.825 --> 01:53.745
Thanks.

7
02:03.625 --> 02:05.905
Apologize again with thanks.

8
02:31.025 --> 02:32.705
Here is the billing statement.

9
02:32.785 --> 02:37.305
Among the new products, the shampoo and body wash are selling pretty well.

10
02:39.785 --> 02:43.945
Sunscreen and serum sales are also increasing.

11
02:44.025 --> 02:45.225
Okay. Got it.

12
04:01.825 --> 04:02.665
Xu Chi.

13
04:02.745 --> 04:05.265
I told the Research to send you home to rest.

14
04:05.345 --> 04:06.465
Why are you still here?

15
04:07.425 --> 04:09.745
I'd just be idle at home. Might as well work.

16
04:09.825 --> 04:10.665
Ms. Lin, you're done with your meeting?

17
04:14.705 --> 04:16.425
I just ran into Mr. Pi.

18
04:18.465 --> 04:21.345
I told him I asked to help out with the Conference Team.

19
04:22.025 --> 04:24.545
Getting to network with some industry heavyweights

20
04:24.625 --> 04:25.465
is totally worth it.

21
04:26.625 --> 04:27.465
Good to know.

22
04:36.945 --> 04:39.025
Mr. Pi is giving a speech at the summit tomorrow afternoon.

23
04:39.105 --> 04:39.945
I'll bring you along.

24
04:40.025 --> 04:42.025
You can meet some people in the circle.

25
04:42.105 --> 04:44.065
Alright. Thanks, Ms. Lin.

26
04:54.825 --> 04:58.625
Homegrown innovative companies need to handle both sides at once.

27
04:58.705 --> 05:00.385
Survival in the short term

28
05:00.465 --> 05:03.185
and strategic positioning for the long run.

29
05:03.825 --> 05:06.265
Get back to the roots of innovation and value creation.

30
05:06.345 --> 05:10.625
Differentiating globally while sharpening our competitive edge.

31
05:10.705 --> 05:13.585
Multinationals are required to rethink

32
05:13.665 --> 05:15.945
their business objectives and strategies for the China market.

33
05:16.025 --> 05:20.385
Balance risks and opportunities, and be more proactive in finding ways

34
05:20.465 --> 05:23.625
to turn China's unique strengths into global value.

35
05:23.705 --> 05:27.105
For example, product pipelines, business models,

36
05:27.185 --> 05:29.105
R&amp;D capabilities, and talent.

37
05:29.185 --> 05:30.305
Thank you all.

38
05:33.865 --> 05:35.265
Alright. Thank you, Mr. Pi.

39
05:35.865 --> 05:37.945
Next, let's welcome Mr. Ye Xinzhi,

40
05:38.025 --> 05:39.745
partner at C&amp;C Consulting, to the stage.

41
05:39.825 --> 05:40.665
Let's welcome Mr. Ye.

42
05:53.225 --> 05:54.185
Hello, everyone.

43
05:54.905 --> 05:56.585
I'm Ye Xinzhi from C&amp;C Consulting.

44
05:58.225 --> 06:00.905
Your presentation earlier was brilliant.

45
06:00.985 --> 06:02.505
I learned so much from you.

46
06:02.585 --> 06:04.265
Mr. Chen. Mr. Li.

47
06:04.345 --> 06:05.865
-Long time no see. -Long time no see.

48
06:06.385 --> 06:07.905
Hello. I'm Xu Chi from Maxmise Consulting.

49
06:07.985 --> 06:10.945
-Hello. -Which part did you find most interesting?

50
06:11.025 --> 06:12.305
Sure. Right?

51
06:13.065 --> 06:13.905
Long time no see.

52
06:13.985 --> 06:14.945
How have you been?

53
06:16.305 --> 06:17.745
Thanks, Ms. Lin.

54
06:17.825 --> 06:19.705
New-quality productive forces are a hot topic right now.

55
06:19.785 --> 06:22.545
Our entire team will be paying more attention to it.

56
06:22.625 --> 06:23.505
So whenever you get the chance,

57
06:23.585 --> 06:25.825
you should connect more with the leaders in this space.

58
06:26.545 --> 06:27.705
Got it.

59
06:27.785 --> 06:28.865
Look.

60
06:28.945 --> 06:32.065
This is Mr. Yan, President of the Yunshang Internet Association.

61
06:32.145 --> 06:33.225
I'll head over first.

62
06:34.705 --> 06:35.825
-Mr. Yan. -Hey.

63
06:35.905 --> 06:37.905
-Long time no see. -Long time no see.

64
06:37.985 --> 06:38.945
Been busy lately?

65
06:39.025 --> 06:40.785
Yeah. Always busy.

66
06:41.905 --> 06:43.305
Why didn't you reply to my messages?

67
06:43.385 --> 06:46.345
I wanted to ask you about the Suhu AI industry cluster before,

68
06:46.425 --> 06:48.025
but you never got back to me.

69
06:48.105 --> 06:50.185
I figured you must have just forgotten with how busy you are.

70
06:50.785 --> 06:51.745
You bet.

71
06:51.825 --> 06:53.185
‎2025 EMPOWERING WITH DIGITAL ‎LEADING THE FUTURE

72
06:53.265 --> 06:54.385
Let me introduce you.

73
06:54.465 --> 06:56.505
This is my new colleague, Xu Chi.

74
06:56.585 --> 06:57.865
-Hi. -Hello.

75
07:00.305 --> 07:01.465
Mr. Yan.

76
07:01.545 --> 07:03.105
I've got some inside info.

77
07:03.185 --> 07:05.305
This morning, Wanghu Pavilion Restaurant upstairs

78
07:05.385 --> 07:07.225
just got in some top-quality hairtail.

79
07:07.305 --> 07:08.185
The best delicacy.

80
07:08.265 --> 07:09.465
Really?

81
07:10.105 --> 07:12.225
Since we're already here, why don't we head upstairs and chat?

82
07:12.305 --> 07:13.345
Sure.

83
07:13.865 --> 07:14.745
Come on.

84
07:15.545 --> 07:16.505
Come on.

85
07:24.625 --> 07:26.105
Hello. Could you tell me where the Chinese restaurant is?

86
07:26.185 --> 07:27.705
-Over there. -Thanks.

87
07:40.225 --> 07:41.065
What's wrong?

88
07:42.465 --> 07:43.465
I'm fine.

89
07:46.425 --> 07:48.065
Did you drink on your own, or were you pressured into it?

90
07:51.105 --> 07:52.185
Take a guess.

91
07:56.985 --> 07:58.225
You'd better watch your back.

92
07:59.465 --> 08:00.905
You think I just got propositioned?

93
08:07.825 --> 08:08.905
What really happened?

94
08:10.905 --> 08:11.745
Someone's out to get me.

95
08:15.305 --> 08:16.425
Mr. Yan, you're the man.

96
08:16.505 --> 08:18.265
The summit's got every private room booked today,

97
08:18.345 --> 08:20.145
but the moment I dropped your name,

98
08:20.225 --> 08:21.705
-one opened up. -Really?

99
08:22.865 --> 08:24.945
The fish will be here soon. Let's wait a bit.

100
08:25.025 --> 08:26.065
Sure thing.

101
08:26.785 --> 08:27.745
Let me take this call.

102
08:31.505 --> 08:32.625
Hello, Mr. Zhao.

103
08:35.264 --> 08:38.505
You really need to come to me for this? Can't you handle it yourself?

104
08:39.024 --> 08:40.065
Gotta go.

105
08:40.985 --> 08:42.065
Be sharp.

106
08:42.144 --> 08:43.904
-Mr. Yan likes being flattered. -Try this.

107
08:43.985 --> 08:45.385
-He hates awkward silences. -Thanks.

108
08:47.905 --> 08:49.305
Mr. Yan.

109
08:49.385 --> 08:53.505
You just said future policies will regulate AI misuse.

110
08:53.585 --> 08:54.945
How strict will that be?

111
08:55.025 --> 08:56.345
Very strict.

112
08:56.865 --> 09:00.105
In our lingo, "Regulatory action needs to hit the mark and hit hard."

113
09:00.985 --> 09:02.745
Like when you were a kid, didn't listen to your dad,

114
09:02.825 --> 09:05.505
and got spanked.

115
09:07.985 --> 09:09.545
Mr. Yan, you really have a sense of humor.

116
09:09.625 --> 09:12.545
My belly hurts from laughing.

117
09:12.625 --> 09:14.025
Don't hurt the baby.

118
09:14.105 --> 09:15.625
If anything happened to the little one,

119
09:15.705 --> 09:17.545
-I'd never forgive myself. -Not at all.

120
09:17.625 --> 09:18.545
My bad.

121
09:18.625 --> 09:19.825
I'll take a drink as an apology.

122
09:21.145 --> 09:22.225
Where's the wine?

123
09:22.305 --> 09:23.585
-Excuse me. -Hello.

124
09:23.665 --> 09:24.585
Come on.

125
09:25.825 --> 09:29.265
Bring me your best wine. Quick.

126
09:29.345 --> 09:31.225
-Got it. -Hurry up.

127
09:32.025 --> 09:34.025
Good fish calls for good wine.

128
09:34.105 --> 09:35.385
-Right? -Yeah.

129
09:35.465 --> 09:36.745
One second. Wait a moment. Here.

130
09:36.825 --> 09:38.345
-Let's try something else. -Okay.

131
09:40.265 --> 09:41.665
Let's toast.

132
09:41.745 --> 09:44.225
Mr. Yan, I'm so happy I totally forgot.

133
09:44.305 --> 09:46.585
I can't have any alcohol right now.

134
09:47.265 --> 09:49.545
But today we've got Xu as backup. No worries.

135
09:50.465 --> 09:52.185
Ms. Lin, I told you I'm allergic to alcohol.

136
09:53.505 --> 09:55.145
So what do we do now?

137
09:55.225 --> 09:56.825
I'm pregnant. Can't have me drinking, right?

138
09:59.625 --> 10:01.065
Don't worry. Just take it slow.

139
10:01.145 --> 10:02.385
Build up your tolerance.

140
10:02.465 --> 10:03.425
Exactly.

141
10:04.265 --> 10:05.545
That's how everything works.

142
10:06.185 --> 10:08.785
First time's awkward, second time's easy.

143
10:09.825 --> 10:10.625
Mr. Yan, I really don't drink.

144
10:11.465 --> 10:13.145
Cheers.

145
10:13.825 --> 10:15.425
-Drink up. -Mr. Yan, I don't--

146
10:15.505 --> 10:17.185
Come on.

147
10:19.425 --> 10:20.465
There you go.

148
10:20.545 --> 10:21.425
Right?

149
10:26.145 --> 10:27.345
My superior set me up.

150
10:28.025 --> 10:29.585
I had to drink way too much.

151
10:30.225 --> 10:32.505
I kept pinching myself while trying to find a way out.

152
10:32.585 --> 10:35.425
Then she went to the restroom and left her phone behind.

153
10:35.945 --> 10:38.585
Her husband kept calling her.

154
10:39.105 --> 10:40.825
I was worried it was urgent, so I answered.

155
10:41.425 --> 10:42.585
The next thing,

156
10:45.745 --> 10:47.505
her husband showed up furious.

157
10:48.585 --> 10:51.745
Mr. Yan got a face full of wine. That was the end of that dinner.

158
10:54.785 --> 10:56.985
Are you expecting me to praise you or chew you out?

159
10:57.705 --> 10:58.745
She's pregnant.

160
10:59.345 --> 11:01.105
So just because she's pregnant,

161
11:02.105 --> 11:04.105
I'm supposed to take it lying down?

162
11:04.705 --> 11:05.745
Look,

163
11:06.265 --> 11:09.305
if someone treats me with respect, I return it tenfold,

164
11:09.385 --> 11:12.145
but if they cross me, I'm not a pushover.

165
11:14.625 --> 11:16.825
You've got a strong sense of both defense and offense.

166
11:19.505 --> 11:22.465
Seems like your days at Maxmise

167
11:22.545 --> 11:23.745
aren't easy.

168
11:24.665 --> 11:26.225
I've been more than decent to her.

169
11:26.305 --> 11:28.825
I did everything I could. I put up with everything I could!

170
11:28.905 --> 11:31.025
Out of all the new hires, I'm the best and the hardest-working.

171
11:31.105 --> 11:32.265
What more does she want?

172
11:32.345 --> 11:33.705
She's a woman too.

173
11:33.785 --> 11:35.105
How could she come up with such a dirty trick?

174
11:35.785 --> 11:37.385
Because she feels threatened.

175
11:38.345 --> 11:39.505
She's afraid you'll replace her.

176
11:39.585 --> 11:42.185
No way! She's my mentor.

177
11:42.265 --> 11:44.785
I'm just an intern business analyst.

178
11:45.985 --> 11:48.545
People who don't feel secure often lose out

179
11:48.625 --> 11:49.705
on a lot of opportunities at work.

180
11:50.305 --> 11:52.385
Killing off a threatening young lion early

181
11:52.465 --> 11:54.305
is the most common move among adult lions.

182
12:02.425 --> 12:05.185
One bottle of water bought you 20 minutes of career advice.

183
12:05.265 --> 12:06.385
Pretty good deal.

184
12:08.545 --> 12:09.825
You want me to walk you down and call you a cab?

185
12:12.785 --> 12:16.345
I wasn't in the bathroom throwing up because my stomach hurt.

186
12:17.225 --> 12:19.305
Just trying to limit the damage from all that drinking.

187
12:24.505 --> 12:25.505
Still, be careful.

188
12:25.585 --> 12:27.065
Take care of yourself.

189
12:28.385 --> 12:29.425
Mr. Ye.

190
12:33.265 --> 12:34.505
Why did you leave P&amp;J?

191
12:35.385 --> 12:37.065
When I went back to return your sunglasses,

192
12:37.585 --> 12:39.305
I found out you'd already left P&amp;J.

193
12:39.385 --> 12:40.585
OPERATIONS DEPARTMENT YE XINZHI, DIRECTOR OF OPERATIONS

194
12:51.825 --> 12:54.025
I really wanted to thank you in person

195
12:54.105 --> 12:55.305
for your advice back then.

196
12:58.505 --> 12:59.425
No need for that.

197
13:00.025 --> 13:00.985
I was just saying something offhand.

198
13:01.065 --> 13:04.505
Congratulations on making it into Maxmise, just like you wanted.

199
13:05.225 --> 13:06.465
Consultants have a practice.

200
13:07.105 --> 13:10.025
Sometimes we take a gap at a corporate just to stay connected to the market.

201
13:10.105 --> 13:13.465
When you met me back then, I happened to be gapping at P&amp;J.

202
13:13.545 --> 13:16.185
C&amp;C Consulting and Maxmise are competitors.

203
13:16.265 --> 13:18.665
This hotel is packed with summit attendees.

204
13:18.745 --> 13:20.025
People might get the wrong idea.

205
13:21.225 --> 13:23.025
You should head back. Good luck.

206
13:41.505 --> 13:48.305
XU CHI LOVES MOM

207
13:49.265 --> 13:50.665
Mom, look.

208
13:59.065 --> 14:01.785
I love coming to Grandma's apartment in Beijing.

209
14:01.865 --> 14:03.945
-Mom. I want some tanghulu. -Let's go!

210
14:36.705 --> 14:39.785
NO. 92, YONG'AN ROAD

211
14:56.265 --> 14:57.105
Lin Long.

212
14:58.985 --> 15:00.225
Why are you so late?

213
15:02.745 --> 15:03.985
You look worn out.

214
15:05.505 --> 15:08.025
-You threw wine in his face… -You're pregnant. Why were you drinking?

215
15:08.105 --> 15:09.705
I… I wasn't drinking.

216
15:09.785 --> 15:11.505
-It was just normal business talk. -It is not normal!

217
15:11.585 --> 15:12.985
You're impossible!

218
15:13.065 --> 15:15.065
Don't walk away. Come back and finish what you were saying!

219
15:15.825 --> 15:17.665
I'd say just get a cat.

220
15:17.745 --> 15:19.025
At least it gives you emotional support.

221
15:19.105 --> 15:21.145
A cat works too, but I would still date.

222
15:21.225 --> 15:24.345
And in terms of structure and process, we need to analyze everything.

223
15:24.425 --> 15:25.505
I'm heading off.

224
15:28.305 --> 15:29.345
Morning, Ms. Lin.

225
15:30.385 --> 15:31.225
Morning, Sha Sha.

226
15:31.305 --> 15:32.545
Morning.

227
15:32.625 --> 15:34.145
Mr. Pi is asking about the progress on the Bolo Culture project.

228
15:34.225 --> 15:35.785
Did you set up a meeting time with them this afternoon?

229
15:36.545 --> 15:38.265
Already done. Don't worry.

230
15:38.345 --> 15:40.305
Bolo Culture is very happy with Ms. Lin's proposal.

231
16:05.705 --> 16:06.745
You…

232
16:08.225 --> 16:09.745
Why did you answer my phone for me yesterday?

233
16:11.425 --> 16:12.345
I'm sorry.

234
16:12.425 --> 16:13.785
You told me to drink with Mr. Yan.

235
16:13.865 --> 16:15.785
-I had no idea your husband had a temper. -Lower your voice.

236
16:15.865 --> 16:16.905
Keep your voice down.

237
16:18.625 --> 16:20.145
You want to blow things up, do you?

238
16:21.945 --> 16:24.265
Let me make this clear. Know what you should do

239
16:24.345 --> 16:25.585
and what you shouldn't.

240
16:27.705 --> 16:29.745
People who lack security miss out

241
16:29.825 --> 16:31.345
on a lot of opportunities in the workplace.

242
16:32.025 --> 16:35.905
Killing off a threatening young lion early is the most common move among adult lions.

243
16:36.545 --> 16:37.785
Got it.

244
16:37.865 --> 16:41.185
What I should do is get the Yuanming proposal done for you.

245
17:02.345 --> 17:03.225
What's wrong?

246
17:04.865 --> 17:07.345
That girl is absolutely awful! I completely misjudged her!

247
17:08.265 --> 17:09.704
Calm down.

248
17:09.785 --> 17:12.105
Your performance has ranked number one for years.

249
17:12.184 --> 17:13.704
Nothing to worry about.

250
17:13.785 --> 17:16.905
It's just a newbie trying to stand out. We've seen plenty of those over the years.

251
17:17.865 --> 17:19.704
Just don't let her shine on any projects.

252
17:19.785 --> 17:21.464
She'll leave on her own in a couple of days.

253
17:31.745 --> 17:33.225
Once we get to Bolo Culture,

254
17:33.305 --> 17:35.785
don't say a single word without my permission.

255
17:35.865 --> 17:37.665
-Got it? -Got it.

256
17:47.105 --> 17:48.865
Regarding the organizational efficiency development after your acquisition

257
17:48.945 --> 17:49.945
of Qingyi Literature,

258
17:50.025 --> 17:53.785
Maxmise recommends a focused integration of copyright content and design.

259
17:53.865 --> 17:54.705
MR. SHEN, BOLO CULTURE

260
17:54.785 --> 17:55.665
Maxmise suggests establishing

261
17:55.745 --> 17:57.345
a dedicated efficiency improvement team, Exercise Evaluation Team, also called EET.

262
17:57.425 --> 18:00.865
EET serves as the key driver for the entire cost-reduction project,

263
18:00.945 --> 18:02.745
using data-driven methods

264
18:02.825 --> 18:04.505
to push deep collaboration across organizations

265
18:04.585 --> 18:06.185
and restructure cost frameworks.

266
18:06.265 --> 18:07.105
At the top level,

267
18:07.185 --> 18:09.105
the steering committee acts as sponsor, providing strategic direction.

268
18:09.185 --> 18:11.825
At the execution level, the EET lead consolidates resources,

269
18:11.905 --> 18:12.745
extending downward

270
18:12.825 --> 18:14.585
into five functional areas, including process optimization,

271
18:14.665 --> 18:15.905
data analysis, HR coordination,

272
18:15.985 --> 18:18.265
finance coordination, and IT system integration,

273
18:18.345 --> 18:20.625
-forming an end-to-end closed loop. -Mr. Shen.

274
18:21.465 --> 18:23.025
Something doesn't feel right to you?

275
18:23.625 --> 18:24.905
Actually, yes.

276
18:26.505 --> 18:31.505
Ms. Lin, can you just tell me straight up what we actually need to do

277
18:31.585 --> 18:34.665
to get the veteran Qingyi employees to integrate into our group,

278
18:34.745 --> 18:37.105
fall in line, and stay motivated at the same time?

279
18:37.185 --> 18:39.785
-Give me something useful. -Useful stuff…

280
18:40.945 --> 18:41.785
Coming up.

281
18:54.185 --> 18:55.185
The biggest problem

282
18:55.265 --> 18:56.945
with Qingyi Literature is its chaotic internal management.

283
18:57.025 --> 18:58.945
‎ORGANIZATIONAL STRUCTURE: OVERLY FLAT

284
18:59.545 --> 19:01.305
It's been around for a while,

285
19:01.905 --> 19:02.945
but--

286
19:05.305 --> 19:06.345
Ms. Lin.

287
19:06.905 --> 19:07.945
You want to take a break?

288
19:08.585 --> 19:10.865
Yeah, yeah. Let's go downstairs and grab some coffee.

289
19:16.585 --> 19:19.145
Seriously, is that all they've got?

290
19:19.225 --> 19:22.545
A few PowerPoint slides and some plans, and they dare charge us eight figures?

291
19:22.625 --> 19:24.305
What year is this?

292
19:24.385 --> 19:27.025
These consulting firms still think we're easy money.

293
19:27.105 --> 19:27.985
Exactly.

294
19:31.145 --> 19:32.625
Let me give you two numbers.

295
19:33.785 --> 19:37.865
One-third of Fortune 500 board chairs have a background

296
19:37.945 --> 19:39.265
in management consulting.

297
19:39.345 --> 19:40.665
That's true.

298
19:40.745 --> 19:42.825
A lot of traditional consulting firms are just big talkers.

299
19:42.905 --> 19:47.545
But what I value is Maxmise's status as a top global firm

300
19:47.625 --> 19:49.585
and the management expertise, operating models,

301
19:49.665 --> 19:51.425
and databases they bring to the table.

302
19:51.505 --> 19:53.025
Those are real battle-tested assets

303
19:53.105 --> 19:56.705
they built up over decades across dozens of countries.

304
19:56.785 --> 20:00.825
We're taking our IP commercial and global. Who else are we going to rely on?

305
20:01.425 --> 20:02.585
You?

306
20:03.585 --> 20:04.465
You guys?

307
20:05.065 --> 20:06.945
You're going to go to Rio, to Osaka,

308
20:07.025 --> 20:09.785
country by country doing market research?

309
20:09.865 --> 20:12.145
By the time you're done, it'll be too late.

310
20:13.425 --> 20:15.225
But their proposal just now really wasn't good enough.

311
20:16.945 --> 20:18.185
Then we won't choose them.

312
20:18.265 --> 20:20.385
Besides Maxmise, there are other firms.

313
20:20.985 --> 20:22.785
Let's use this project to test the waters first.

314
20:23.465 --> 20:24.385
Warm water.

315
20:26.545 --> 20:29.545
Why did you speak without my permission just now?

316
20:29.625 --> 20:30.705
What did I tell you before we came?

317
20:30.785 --> 20:32.065
They were all zoning out.

318
20:33.185 --> 20:34.745
Using a question to recapture the client's attention

319
20:34.825 --> 20:36.425
and pull them back into the discussion.

320
20:36.505 --> 20:38.025
That's a proposal technique you taught me.

321
20:38.985 --> 20:40.905
I'm warning you one last time. Just one.

322
20:40.985 --> 20:43.265
If you want to get through your internship smoothly,

323
20:43.345 --> 20:44.705
stay in your lane.

324
20:48.345 --> 20:49.425
Mr. Shen.

325
20:49.505 --> 20:52.025
Sorry about that.

326
20:52.545 --> 20:54.865
No worries. You're in a special situation after all.

327
20:55.745 --> 20:58.185
But I do suggest that if you're really not feeling well,

328
20:58.265 --> 20:59.745
maybe take some time off.

329
20:59.825 --> 21:01.785
Work isn't more important than your baby.

330
21:23.705 --> 21:25.305
Xu Chi, what are you doing?

331
21:25.385 --> 21:26.825
Wait, what do you mean?

332
21:26.905 --> 21:29.825
Mr. Shen, you asked how to get Qingyi employees

333
21:29.905 --> 21:31.425
to listen, work hard, and integrate, right?

334
21:31.505 --> 21:34.945
The solution is to use money to bring in a new cohort of employees.

335
21:38.705 --> 21:40.465
Qingyi has been around for over 20 years.

336
21:40.545 --> 21:43.745
Their average employee age is around 45.

337
21:43.825 --> 21:45.625
They're used to family-style workshop management.

338
21:45.705 --> 21:47.505
Getting them to quickly integrate

339
21:47.585 --> 21:49.305
into Bolo Culture, which has only existed for five years,

340
21:49.385 --> 21:51.945
is as hard as me suddenly becoming

341
21:52.025 --> 21:53.145
a top web novelist making 50,000 a month.

342
21:53.945 --> 21:58.465
Since your company isn't short on cash, and all you care about is Qingyi's IPs,

343
21:58.545 --> 21:59.545
why not start fresh?

344
22:00.305 --> 22:01.505
Keep the senior executives for now.

345
22:01.585 --> 22:03.105
Let all other former Qingyi employees leave

346
22:03.185 --> 22:06.065
with the market's best severance package of 2N plus 10.

347
22:06.905 --> 22:09.425
That way, regular employees can retire.

348
22:09.505 --> 22:11.305
It also cleans up the mess quickly.

349
22:11.905 --> 22:13.985
And it boosts Bolo Culture's brand reputation.

350
22:14.065 --> 22:15.025
Three birds with one stone.

351
22:19.545 --> 22:22.825
Actually, I've always felt that a lean, boutique HR structure

352
22:22.905 --> 22:24.785
is one of your company's greatest strengths.

353
22:24.865 --> 22:27.865
So the follow-up reform plan should also revolve around that.

354
22:28.705 --> 22:29.545
Tell me more.

355
22:29.625 --> 22:32.545
Let's save the suspense for after the proposal meeting.

356
22:32.625 --> 22:34.265
Sorry, Ms. Lin,

357
22:34.345 --> 22:35.305
I don't like suspense.

358
22:37.865 --> 22:39.305
-Go on. -Alright.

359
22:42.785 --> 22:44.145
Based on our preliminary research,

360
22:44.225 --> 22:47.505
we found that Bolo Culture's incentive system is actually quite solid,

361
22:47.585 --> 22:50.505
but it has three coexisting pay models,

362
22:50.585 --> 22:53.025
namely position-based, skill-based, and performance-based.

363
22:53.105 --> 22:54.465
It's overly mixed.

364
22:54.545 --> 22:56.065
So here we suggest…

365
22:58.825 --> 23:00.025
Thank you both for today.

366
23:00.545 --> 23:02.665
Miss Xu, your proposal was excellent.

367
23:03.945 --> 23:04.985
You're too kind.

368
23:05.065 --> 23:07.385
Maxmise has always been committed to providing our clients

369
23:07.465 --> 23:08.985
with the highest quality consulting services.

370
23:09.065 --> 23:10.865
And of course, thank you too, Ms. Lin.

371
23:11.385 --> 23:12.345
You have a great team.

372
23:15.265 --> 23:16.105
Thanks for the compliment.

373
23:16.945 --> 23:18.185
We'll get back to you soon.

374
23:19.145 --> 23:20.865
-Looking forward to it. -No need to see us out.

375
23:33.345 --> 23:34.425
Happy now?

376
23:34.505 --> 23:35.665
Had enough of the spotlight?

377
23:35.745 --> 23:38.385
I helped salvage a project that was about to fall through.

378
23:38.465 --> 23:40.905
As a member of the team, of course, I'm happy.

379
23:42.745 --> 23:44.545
A member of the team?

380
23:44.625 --> 23:45.945
Don't think I can't see it.

381
23:46.025 --> 23:48.945
You joined Maxmise just to replace me.

382
23:52.705 --> 23:54.145
Ms. Lin, you're overthinking it.

383
23:54.225 --> 23:56.305
I'm just an intern analyst.

384
23:56.385 --> 23:59.025
I wouldn't set replacing a consultant two levels above me

385
23:59.105 --> 24:00.385
as a goal.

386
24:01.385 --> 24:03.505
You can fool others, but not me.

387
24:04.025 --> 24:05.105
I'm really not lying to you.

388
24:05.705 --> 24:07.785
Because my goal isn't to replace you at all.

389
24:07.865 --> 24:11.705
It's to become someone in this city who can never be replaced.

390
24:30.265 --> 24:31.505
Go on your own.

391
24:31.585 --> 24:33.585
My car can't fit a dream that big.

392
24:46.425 --> 24:47.585
Sha Sha, do you have a minute?

393
24:48.105 --> 24:49.145
Come in.

394
24:50.345 --> 24:52.465
I'd like to talk to you about the Bolo Culture project.

395
24:54.345 --> 24:56.185
That management team is indeed a bit young.

396
24:56.265 --> 24:57.105
Tough to handle.

397
24:57.185 --> 24:58.985
Luckily, I changed the proposal on the fly.

398
24:59.065 --> 25:00.185
They've given preliminary approval.

399
25:01.305 --> 25:02.305
Take a look.

400
25:06.185 --> 25:09.185
But Xu Chi did something absolutely ridiculous today.

401
25:10.145 --> 25:11.225
She secretly pulled out

402
25:11.305 --> 25:14.825
a stack of cash and tried to bribe Bolo Culture's CEO.

403
25:15.705 --> 25:17.345
You have no idea how awkward it was.

404
25:17.425 --> 25:19.225
I can't even describe it.

405
25:19.745 --> 25:20.825
Really?

406
25:21.585 --> 25:24.785
Xu Chi is indeed a capable girl.

407
25:25.385 --> 25:27.265
But that kind of behavior violates business ethics,

408
25:27.345 --> 25:28.705
and it's a huge red flag at Maxmise.

409
25:29.305 --> 25:31.705
I don't think I'm suitable to be her mentor anymore.

410
25:31.785 --> 25:34.305
I suggest we terminate her probation early.

411
25:36.145 --> 25:37.185
Is that really what you want?

412
25:38.985 --> 25:40.945
That way, she can still go to other companies.

413
25:44.025 --> 25:45.225
Nice proposal.

414
25:46.345 --> 25:49.625
But 20 minutes ago, Xu Chi sent me one too.

415
25:50.945 --> 25:52.505
Her thinking is exactly the same…

416
25:52.585 --> 25:53.785
PRODUCER - LIN LONG, XU CHI

417
25:53.865 --> 25:54.905
…as yours.

418
25:56.465 --> 25:58.185
No-- Sha Sha, this--

419
25:58.265 --> 25:59.425
I can explain--

420
25:59.505 --> 26:01.105
Do you think that's necessary, Lin Long?

421
26:01.705 --> 26:03.185
You've been with me for so long.

422
26:03.705 --> 26:06.505
I've never overlooked your personality or your needs.

423
26:08.225 --> 26:09.865
You thought Cindy poached the Sato Pharmaceuticals project from you,

424
26:09.945 --> 26:12.425
so I immediately gave you the Bolo Culture project.

425
26:13.145 --> 26:15.465
Now you're pregnant and low on energy,

426
26:15.545 --> 26:16.585
so I found you an assistant.

427
26:16.665 --> 26:18.545
You picked Xu Chi yourself,

428
26:18.625 --> 26:21.385
and she's the most capable among this batch of new hires.

429
26:21.465 --> 26:24.145
I don't know what went wrong in your communication,

430
26:24.225 --> 26:26.545
but when it comes to teamwork,

431
26:27.225 --> 26:28.185
she did better than you.

432
26:28.265 --> 26:30.105
But she always acts on her own.

433
26:30.825 --> 26:32.145
Does she even see me as her mentor?

434
26:32.225 --> 26:34.505
She goes over my head on everything without my approval.

435
26:35.265 --> 26:37.505
Performance is the only thing that matters.

436
26:38.265 --> 26:39.705
You can't expect to only ever have subordinates

437
26:39.785 --> 26:41.025
who are less capable than you.

438
26:41.945 --> 26:45.465
Whether you can manage them well depends on your leadership.

439
26:45.545 --> 26:47.705
The net you wove is too loose to hold her down.

440
26:47.785 --> 26:48.945
So she just slips through the gaps and rises--

441
26:49.025 --> 26:50.625
So this is all my fault then?

442
26:53.105 --> 26:54.305
You're not in a good state today.

443
26:56.105 --> 26:57.945
I suggest you take your leave immediately.

444
27:06.305 --> 27:08.305
You like taking on work, don't you? Then all of this is yours now.

445
27:19.545 --> 27:20.585
Well done.

446
27:26.665 --> 27:27.785
Well done.

447
27:27.865 --> 27:31.625
BU TIANNA

448
27:34.785 --> 27:38.025
It's just a newbie trying to stand out. We've seen plenty of those over the years.

449
27:38.105 --> 27:39.745
You thought she was a pushover.

450
27:39.825 --> 27:43.025
She waited until everyone forgot, then got her revenge.

451
27:43.105 --> 27:44.865
She is more calculating than you.

452
27:45.465 --> 27:48.345
Xu Chi is clearly someone who can really get things done.

453
27:48.425 --> 27:50.545
If you piss off Mr. Pi because of her,

454
27:50.625 --> 27:53.745
aren't you afraid he'll give you a hard time at work?

455
27:53.825 --> 27:55.225
I just ran into Mr. Pi.

456
27:55.305 --> 27:58.465
I told him I asked to help out with the Conference Team.

457
27:59.945 --> 28:00.945
Ms. Lin, you're overthinking it.

458
28:01.025 --> 28:03.345
I'm just an intern analyst.

459
28:03.425 --> 28:06.105
I wouldn't set replacing a consultant two levels above me

460
28:06.185 --> 28:07.185
as a goal.

461
28:07.785 --> 28:09.945
Performance is the only thing that matters.

462
28:10.665 --> 28:12.105
You can't expect to only ever have subordinates

463
28:12.185 --> 28:13.425
who are less capable than you.

464
28:26.105 --> 28:27.785
Watch where you're going!

465
28:39.825 --> 28:40.945
Sorry about that.

466
28:41.465 --> 28:44.305
My fault entirely. We can do a fast-track insurance claim.

467
28:46.025 --> 28:47.065
Ms. Lin?

468
28:48.425 --> 28:49.425
Mr. Shen?

469
28:50.505 --> 28:52.105
-I'm really sorry. I-- -You're bleeding.

470
28:57.465 --> 28:59.305
You're pregnant. How could you drive so carelessly?

471
29:00.065 --> 29:00.905
Is the baby okay?

472
29:02.785 --> 29:04.225
-It's fine. -You're hurt.

473
29:04.305 --> 29:06.905
I'll take full responsibility. I'll take you to the hospital.

474
29:13.625 --> 29:14.745
Doctor, the fees are paid.

475
29:14.825 --> 29:16.265
-Alright. -How is she?

476
29:16.345 --> 29:17.745
The wound isn't deep. No stitches needed.

477
29:17.825 --> 29:19.025
Just clean it

478
29:19.105 --> 29:20.945
and apply the medicine once a day for three days straight.

479
29:21.025 --> 29:23.185
The wound is in her hair. It's not really noticeable.

480
29:24.065 --> 29:25.225
Is the baby okay?

481
29:25.305 --> 29:26.905
We ran all the tests. Everything's fine.

482
29:26.985 --> 29:29.025
But I've warned her before.

483
29:29.105 --> 29:31.345
I told her to make sure she gets plenty of rest.

484
29:31.425 --> 29:33.625
But this time I saw that her heart rate is too fast.

485
29:33.705 --> 29:35.625
It's worse than last time.

486
29:36.265 --> 29:37.345
As the father,

487
29:37.425 --> 29:38.905
you should come with her for more prenatal checkups--

488
29:38.985 --> 29:40.025
No, no. Doctor, that's not it.

489
29:40.105 --> 29:42.225
He's just my business partner, not the baby's father.

490
29:43.385 --> 29:45.625
I'm definitely not her husband.

491
29:45.705 --> 29:46.545
I'm her client.

492
29:48.825 --> 29:49.665
I'll wait outside.

493
30:05.985 --> 30:07.705
Sorry about earlier.

494
30:08.825 --> 30:10.905
I barely thought it was a big deal. Don't mention it.

495
30:13.705 --> 30:14.545
Thanks for driving me home.

496
30:17.465 --> 30:18.945
Don't get the wrong idea.

497
30:19.745 --> 30:21.345
It's just that you're pregnant.

498
30:21.425 --> 30:23.705
If something happened to you, I couldn't bear that responsibility.

499
30:24.665 --> 30:27.745
You must be four or five months along?

500
30:29.105 --> 30:30.705
When my sister was pregnant,

501
30:30.785 --> 30:32.705
she was already on bed rest at this stage.

502
30:33.305 --> 30:35.105
You're either running to our company

503
30:35.185 --> 30:37.225
and standing for hours giving presentations

504
30:37.305 --> 30:39.465
or playing Fast &amp; Furious on your own.

505
30:40.065 --> 30:42.665
Is it really worth working yourself to the bone for your company?

506
30:45.305 --> 30:46.505
That's just how we consultants are.

507
30:47.225 --> 30:48.825
And Maxmise really values

508
30:48.905 --> 30:50.905
-this Bolo Culture project… -Alright, alright. Stop it.

509
30:50.985 --> 30:53.985
It's just the two of us here. No need for all that corporate flattery.

510
30:55.625 --> 30:58.625
I'll give you a little inside scoop. Your company has a good shot at this deal.

511
30:58.705 --> 31:02.625
So I suggest you just go home and rest up.

512
31:02.705 --> 31:05.465
Leave the rest to Miss Xu.

513
31:05.545 --> 31:06.945
She can handle the follow-up.

514
31:07.025 --> 31:08.185
Xu Chi?

515
31:11.225 --> 31:12.905
That's not really appropriate. She… She's…

516
31:12.985 --> 31:14.865
She's inexperienced, and she just joined the company--

517
31:14.945 --> 31:16.545
And you're so experienced?

518
31:17.065 --> 31:19.265
Your proposal wasn't that great.

519
31:19.345 --> 31:20.865
Full of clichés.

520
31:20.945 --> 31:21.865
You think you can just swap out a model template

521
31:21.945 --> 31:23.345
and rip us off?

522
31:23.425 --> 31:25.425
Think we're just some dumb money waiting to be fleeced?

523
31:25.505 --> 31:27.265
Xu Chi's proposal was more interesting than yours--

524
31:27.345 --> 31:28.345
Enough already!

525
31:29.305 --> 31:30.545
What?

526
31:31.105 --> 31:32.345
What's your problem?

527
31:35.265 --> 31:37.585
Sorry. I've been feeling a bit unstable emotionally.

528
31:43.505 --> 31:45.305
Your pregnancy hormones are all over the place.

529
31:45.385 --> 31:46.305
I get that.

530
31:47.025 --> 31:48.305
But let me give you some advice.

531
31:48.945 --> 31:51.625
Don't let this cost you clients, cost you your boss,

532
31:51.705 --> 31:53.265
and then cost you your husband.

533
31:53.345 --> 31:55.785
Then you've got nothing left.

534
31:55.865 --> 31:57.305
Game over. Got it?

535
32:21.145 --> 32:22.905
FOOD DELIVERIES PLEASE LEAVE AT DOOR TABLE ON THE LEFT

536
32:56.905 --> 32:58.345
Okay. I'll have three.

537
32:58.425 --> 32:59.265
I want two more.

538
32:59.865 --> 33:01.465
-Impossible! -What's making you guys so happy?

539
33:02.505 --> 33:05.465
Ms. Sha. Xu Chi has been the first one in the office

540
33:05.545 --> 33:06.865
for 27 days straight.

541
33:07.545 --> 33:09.305
We were just chatting.

542
33:09.385 --> 33:11.705
Wondering if she can keep it up through the whole internship.

543
33:24.785 --> 33:25.705
Zhiwen.

544
33:27.545 --> 33:29.425
Zhiwen. The baby kicked.

545
33:29.945 --> 33:30.985
Come listen.

546
33:41.425 --> 33:42.425
Sha Sha.

547
33:46.185 --> 33:48.745
I want to apologize for my attitude yesterday.

548
33:48.825 --> 33:49.865
I wasn't in a good place.

549
33:49.945 --> 33:53.105
I don't even know if it's the pregnancy.

550
33:54.065 --> 33:56.465
I've been through everything you're going through.

551
33:57.385 --> 34:01.225
Women make up less than a third of the employees at Maxmise.

552
34:01.865 --> 34:04.185
Helping you is helping myself.

553
34:07.225 --> 34:08.425
From now on,

554
34:08.505 --> 34:10.225
I'll focus on the Yuanming project.

555
34:10.304 --> 34:13.665
Let Xu Chi take over the Bolo Culture project.

556
34:13.744 --> 34:14.905
I'll just oversee from behind.

557
34:16.625 --> 34:18.025
That's the smart choice.

558
34:19.145 --> 34:20.985
Nothing is more important than your health.

559
34:22.905 --> 34:25.304
Don't worry. When you come back,

560
34:25.385 --> 34:26.905
your position and responsibilities won't change.

561
34:26.985 --> 34:28.385
That's my promise.

562
34:30.065 --> 34:31.145
Thanks.

563
35:28.425 --> 35:30.065
What's got you so happy?

564
35:31.385 --> 35:32.345
Mr. Ye?

565
35:33.785 --> 35:34.985
Have a seat.

566
35:36.505 --> 35:37.665
Call me Richard.

567
35:37.745 --> 35:40.465
Or, as your company does, don't use an English name.

568
35:40.545 --> 35:41.745
Call me Ye Xinzhi.

569
35:43.065 --> 35:44.385
Just drop the "Mr." stuff.

570
35:44.465 --> 35:49.105
In the CBD, if you shout that, four out of ten people will turn around.

571
35:50.505 --> 35:52.385
Hi. A beer, please.

572
35:52.465 --> 35:53.545
Sure thing, sir.

573
35:53.625 --> 35:55.345
-I'll have another one too. -Got it.

574
36:00.425 --> 36:01.425
Thanks.

575
36:03.665 --> 36:06.545
Off work this early and so thrilled? Did you pull off a coup or something?

576
36:09.745 --> 36:11.945
After all this time at Maxmise, I finally get to lead a project on my own.

577
36:16.065 --> 36:18.025
Got a promotion? A raise?

578
36:18.105 --> 36:20.105
Did your probation end early?

579
36:22.305 --> 36:24.185
Wipe that smug look off your face.

580
36:24.265 --> 36:26.745
Lots of people from nearby offices eat here.

581
36:26.825 --> 36:27.745
The consulting world is small.

582
36:28.345 --> 36:31.585
If someone saw you looking like you just got revenge,

583
36:32.185 --> 36:34.385
and it ended up online…

584
36:37.305 --> 36:39.945
Last time you told me to watch my back, and now you're calling me out.

585
36:40.025 --> 36:42.505
Drop the preachy attitude. It's a real turn-off.

586
36:42.585 --> 36:45.105
I hear you. Not changing a thing.

587
36:50.185 --> 36:51.865
You seem pretty happy too.

588
36:52.825 --> 36:54.705
Of course. I just closed a deal.

589
36:54.785 --> 36:56.705
Tianhe Air brand transformation project.

590
36:57.425 --> 36:58.945
What? Jealous?

591
37:01.225 --> 37:02.865
When will I ever get to where you are?

592
37:03.625 --> 37:04.705
When?

593
37:04.785 --> 37:06.945
When you get smile lines, bags under your eyes,

594
37:07.025 --> 37:10.225
and no amount of cosmetic procedures can fix them.

595
37:14.825 --> 37:17.465
Why are you staring at me? I age well.

596
37:22.905 --> 37:25.385
Anyway, congratulations.

597
37:26.105 --> 37:28.545
And thank you

598
37:29.145 --> 37:30.465
for the other day.

599
37:30.545 --> 37:32.945
Your guidance and advice have been invaluable to me.

600
37:34.625 --> 37:37.665
Let me put it plainly. Thank you. Thank you, sir.

601
37:38.425 --> 37:42.345
Please, don't call me "sir." And can you not toast me like that?

602
37:50.705 --> 37:51.945
-Alright. -Cheers.

603
37:52.025 --> 37:53.065
Cheers.

604
37:58.145 --> 37:59.105
By the way,

605
37:59.185 --> 38:02.985
knowing how to dine with clients and pick restaurants is also a skill.

606
38:03.065 --> 38:04.465
French food takes too long.

607
38:04.545 --> 38:06.545
Chinese food has too many dietary restrictions.

608
38:06.625 --> 38:09.265
Italian food? Just wait till you're on business trips.

609
38:09.345 --> 38:11.905
Room service spaghetti bolognese is gonna be all you ever eat.

610
38:12.585 --> 38:14.385
Try to avoid Japanese food

611
38:14.465 --> 38:17.545
because in Japanese culture, men inherently come before women.

612
38:17.625 --> 38:20.865
The atmosphere affects how much a client trusts and respects you.

613
38:20.945 --> 38:22.665
So what kind of place should I go to?

614
38:22.745 --> 38:24.145
Coffee shops.

615
38:24.225 --> 38:25.545
Fast. Efficient.

616
38:25.625 --> 38:27.465
Standardized service. Talk business, then leave.

617
38:27.545 --> 38:28.905
No drinking. No picking anyone up.

618
38:28.985 --> 38:33.385
Also, never pour coffee or tea for anyone at the office.

619
38:33.465 --> 38:35.305
Because you're not a waitress. You're a…

620
38:35.385 --> 38:36.625
Consultant.

621
38:37.505 --> 38:39.145
Right now, you're just an intern analyst.

622
38:39.225 --> 38:42.385
Above you are senior analysts and associate consultants.

623
38:42.465 --> 38:46.425
It'll take you at least two years to make consultant.

624
38:46.505 --> 38:48.425
Well, I came here for that goal.

625
38:49.905 --> 38:53.145
Then I wish you success. Maxmise's elimination rate is brutal.

626
38:53.825 --> 38:55.225
You've got something to say about everything.

627
38:55.305 --> 38:56.865
One minute you're putting me down, the next you're encouraging me.

628
38:56.945 --> 38:58.025
One minute you have me pouring you a drink,

629
38:58.105 --> 38:59.425
the next you tell me to maintain dignity.

630
39:00.825 --> 39:02.665
I was your interviewer.

631
39:02.745 --> 39:03.785
That's different.

632
39:07.905 --> 39:09.465
So as my interviewer,

633
39:09.545 --> 39:12.505
teach me how to land a big deal like Tianhe.

634
39:12.585 --> 39:13.625
Good question.

635
39:14.145 --> 39:15.865
Our firms are competitors.

636
39:15.945 --> 39:17.865
That's confidential. Can I just tell you that?

637
39:18.465 --> 39:20.145
Then why did you teach me how to pick restaurants?

638
39:20.825 --> 39:22.385
Most people don't need to be taught that.

639
39:22.465 --> 39:23.425
It's common sense.

640
39:57.305 --> 39:58.385
Richard.

641
39:59.905 --> 40:00.625
Right away.

642
40:01.945 --> 40:03.145
Then I wish you continued success.

643
40:03.225 --> 40:04.665
And that you buy back your mother's old apartment soon.

644
40:05.265 --> 40:06.505
Get what you came for.

645
40:30.305 --> 40:32.345
Congratulations. You got what you wanted.

646
40:32.865 --> 40:34.185
Still, be careful.

647
40:34.265 --> 40:35.545
Take care of yourself.
